 "description": "anchor#270 (ADR-0022 PR 1): resource type tree on an own product. Built-in organization (search, 409 BUILT_IN on declare/rename/delete), create/duplicate/unknown parent/no parent, cycle, depth 5, resource_type required on role and permission create, permission and role scope immutable, role bundles only permissions at or below its scope, delete/shrink in use (blocked_by, role_ids), whole-tree PUT add + drop, delete + 404, and product.resource_type.* events. Generator: echopoint-investigation/gen_resource_types.py.",
